---
# Every vault_ name this plugin reads, in the host's vault (host_vars/<host>/vault.yml). One line of comment each: what it is for and
# how to make it. `just setup <host>` fills the ones whose placeholder starts with "change-me-generate-with-" with random values.
# Delete this file if the plugin has no secrets. `just check` fails if a name used by the plugin is missing here.
vault_example_password: "change-me-generate-with-openssl-rand-base64-32"
